1
00:00:00,147 --> 00:00:02,277
(Penny:)Trust me,
this is the right thing.

2
00:00:02,282 --> 00:00:03,512
(Sheldon:)I know.

3
00:00:03,517 --> 00:00:05,117
(Leonard:)And it's not like
we're abandoning him.

4
00:00:05,118 --> 00:00:06,288
(Leonard:)Plus,

5
00:00:06,286 --> 00:00:08,616
(Leonard:)we can FaceTime him
whenever we want,

6
00:00:08,622 --> 00:00:12,562
(Leonard:)you know, once iPhones
are invented in his universe.

7
00:00:15,896 --> 00:00:18,526
(Bernadette:)I can't believe Sheldon

8
00:00:18,532 --> 00:00:19,862
(Bernadette:)asked you to be his roommate.

9
00:00:19,866 --> 00:00:23,506
(Bernadette:)I can't believe
he ran my credit.

10
00:00:23,503 --> 00:00:26,003
(Bernadette:)Hey, if you're open to living
with someone great,

11
00:00:26,006 --> 00:00:28,476
I'll give you $1,000
to take Stuart.

12
00:00:29,509 --> 00:00:31,409
(Amy:)You really should've gone
on the Internet

13
00:00:31,411 --> 00:00:33,341
(Amy:)and checked how long
that kind of thing lives

14
00:00:33,346 --> 00:00:35,246
(Amy:)before you got one.

15
00:00:35,248 --> 00:00:36,818
(Bernadette:)I'm sorry.

16
00:00:36,817 --> 00:00:38,017
(Bernadette:)I just thought you might have

17
00:00:38,018 --> 00:00:40,988
(Bernadette:)a pasty, weirdo-shaped hole
in your life.

18
00:00:40,987 --> 00:00:43,357
(Amy:)Hey, I know Sheldon's quirky,

19
00:00:43,356 --> 00:00:45,126
(Amy:)but he's also brilliant
and insightful.

20
00:00:46,326 --> 00:00:49,056
(Amy:)I think calling him a weirdo
is a little unfair.

21
00:00:49,062 --> 00:00:51,432
Hello, 2003!

22
00:00:54,167 --> 00:00:58,027
(Leonard:)Hey, we brought you Thai.

